{
    "title": "Outdoor - Mountain & Sea",
    "description": "Wear OS Watch Face \ud83c\udf04 that showcases beautiful landscapes of the sea \ud83c\udf0a and mountains \u26f0\ufe0f. Enjoy a variety of breathtaking views right on your wrist! \ud83d\udd52\u2728\r\n\r\n <font color=\"#00a675\">Powered by Watch Face Format</font>\r\n\r\n\u2699\ufe0f <font color=\"#00a675\"> Phone App Features</font>\r\n\r\nThe phone app is simply a tool to facilitate installation and locating the watch face on your Wear OS watch. Only the mobile app contains ads. \r\n\r\n\u2699\ufe0f <font color=\"#00a675\"> Watch Face Features</font>\r\n\r\n\u2022 12/24h Digital Time\r\n\u2022 Date\r\n\u2022 Battery\r\n\u2022 Heart rate\r\n\u2022 Steps Count\r\n\u2022 1 customizable Shortcut (visible)\r\n\u2022 3 customizable Complications\r\n\u2022 Power Saver Mode (Check the Store Listing Screens)\r\n\u2022 10 Background Images - Multiple Styles\r\n\u2022 Color Variations\r\n\u2022 Always ON Display \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <font color=\"#00a675\">Customization</font>\r\n\r\n1 - Touch and hold display\r\n2 - Tap on <b>Customize</b> option\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <font color=\"#00a675\">Complications</font>\r\n\r\n<b>Touch and hold</b> display to open customization mode. You can customize the field with any data you want. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0b <font color=\"#00a675\">Battery </font>\r\n\r\nFor better battery performance of the watch, we recommend disabling the \"Always On Display\" mode.\r\n\r\n\u2705 Compatible devices include <font color=\"#00a675\">API level 33+ Google Pixel, Galaxy Watch 4, 5, 6, and other Wear OS models.</font>\r\n\r\n <font color=\"#E97451\">Installation and troubleshooting</font>\r\nFollow this link: https://www.recreative-watch.com/help/#installation-methodes\r\n\r\n <font color=\"#E97451\">Watch faces don't automatically apply on your watch screen after the installation. That's why you must set it on your watch's screen.</font>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8c Write to support@recreative-watch.com for assistance.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Wear OS Watch Face \ud83c\udf04 that showcases beautiful landscapes of the sea \ud83c\udf0a and mountains \u26f0\ufe0f. Enjoy a variety of breathtaking views right on your wrist! \ud83d\udd52\u2728<br><br> <font color=\"#00a675\">Powered by Watch Face Format</font><br><br>\u2699\ufe0f <font color=\"#00a675\"> Phone App Features</font><br><br>The phone app is simply a tool to facilitate installation and locating the watch face on your Wear OS watch. Only the mobile app contains ads. <br><br>\u2699\ufe0f <font color=\"#00a675\"> Watch Face Features</font><br><br>\u2022 12/24h Digital Time<br>\u2022 Date<br>\u2022 Battery<br>\u2022 Heart rate<br>\u2022 Steps Count<br>\u2022 1 customizable Shortcut (visible)<br>\u2022 3 customizable Complications<br>\u2022 Power Saver Mode (Check the Store Listing Screens)<br>\u2022 10 Background Images - Multiple Styles<br>\u2022 Color Variations<br>\u2022 Always ON Display <br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 <font color=\"#00a675\">Customization</font><br><br>1 - Touch and hold display<br>2 - Tap on <b>Customize</b> option<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 <font color=\"#00a675\">Complications</font><br><br><b>Touch and hold</b> display to open customization mode. You can customize the field with any data you want. <br><br>\ud83d\udd0b <font color=\"#00a675\">Battery </font><br><br>For better battery performance of the watch, we recommend disabling the &quot;Always On Display&quot; mode.<br><br>\u2705 Compatible devices include <font color=\"#00a675\">API level 33+ Google Pixel, Galaxy Watch 4, 5, 6, and other Wear OS models.</font><br><br> <font color=\"#E97451\">Installation and troubleshooting</font><br>Follow this link: https://www.recreative-watch.com/help/#installation-methodes<br><br> <font color=\"#E97451\">Watch faces don&#39;t automatically apply on your watch screen after the installation. That&#39;s why you must set it on your watch&#39;s screen.</font><br><br>\ud83d\udc8c Write to support@recreative-watch.com for assistance.",
